 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Totally normal. Stick to simple orders and keep the space between you and the cook big. Order something you can eat with a fork so you hand don't get too dirty. Definitely. A good one with a warm cup of something from the cafe next door. People usually overthink it and end up as though they're at a baby shower. Lovely. Go during the quieter time, after 8 probably. Lots of places get too full on dates. Smart. Lingering is always enjoyable. Which part of lingering do you mean, the long drinks or the big share of pasta?",
